sequenceDiagram
    participant SELLER as Seller/API Gateway
    participant CATALOG as Catalog Service
    participant INVENTORY as Inventory Service
    participant ANALYTICS as Analytics Service
    participant NOTIFICATION as Notification Service
    participant KAFKA as Kafka Event Bus

    Note over SELLER,ANALYTICS: Product Publishing Saga

    SELLER->>CATALOG: POST /products (create product)
    activate CATALOG
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Validate product data
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Process media files (images)
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Create product (DRAFT)
    CATALOG->>KAFKA: Publish ProductCreated event
    CATALOG-->>SELLER: 201 Created (productId)
    deactivate CATALOG

    Note over CATALOG,KAFKA: Saga Step 1: Inventory Verification

    KAFKA->>INVENTORY: ProductCreated event
    activate INVENTORY
    INVENTORY->>INVENTORY: Verify inventory setup required
    INVENTORY->>INVENTORY: Create stock item placeholder
    INVENTORY->>KAFKA: Publish InventoryVerified event
    deactivate INVENTORY

    Note over CATALOG,KAFKA: Saga Step 2: Product Publishing

    SELLER->>CATALOG: PUT /products/:id/publish
    activate CATALOG
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Validate product completeness
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Check inventory verification
    alt All Validations Pass
        CATALOG->>CATALOG: Update product status (PUBLISHED)
        CATALOG->>KAFKA: Publish ProductPublished event
        CATALOG-->>SELLER: 200 OK
    else Validation Failed
        CATALOG->>KAFKA: Publish ProductPublishFailed event
        CATALOG-->>SELLER: 400 Bad Request
    end
    deactivate CATALOG

    Note over CATALOG,KAFKA: Saga Step 3: Analytics Tracking

    KAFKA->>ANALYTICS: ProductCreated, ProductPublished
    activate ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Track product creation
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Update seller metrics
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Update catalog statistics
    deactivate ANALYTICS

    Note over CATALOG,KAFKA: Saga Step 4: Seller Notification

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: ProductPublished event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send product published email
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send tips for optimization
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION

    Note over SELLER,ANALYTICS: Product Update Flow

    SELLER->>CATALOG: PUT /products/:id (update product)
    activate CATALOG
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Validate updates
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Update product data
    CATALOG->>KAFKA: Publish ProductUpdated event
    CATALOG-->>SELLER: 200 OK
    deactivate CATALOG

    KAFKA->>INVENTORY: ProductUpdated event
    activate INVENTORY
    INVENTORY->>INVENTORY: Update stock item metadata
    INVENTORY->>KAFKA: Publish InventoryUpdated event
    deactivate INVENTORY

    KAFKA->>ANALYTICS: ProductUpdated event
    activate ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Track product changes
    deactivate ANALYTICS

    Note over SELLER,ANALYTICS: Compensation Flow - Publish Failure

    KAFKA->>CATALOG: ProductPublishFailed event
    activate CATALOG
    CATALOG->>CATALOG: Revert to DRAFT status
    CATALOG->>KAFKA: Publish ProductReverted event
    deactivate CATALOG

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: ProductPublishFailed event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send failure notification
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Include validation errors
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION
